797..874 Comment "/// A buffer allocated and freed: the allocation places it live, and the free"
875..950 Comment "/// hands it back to the scope that minted it. The `alloc` clause lends its"
951..1019 Comment "/// mint to a mock kernel, which fills it and hands it back with the"
1020..1070 Comment "/// completion, before the clause resumes with it."
